Subject: [PATCH 02/16] physim: PhySim-style frozen suite, truths and
 privileged controls for declared lab worlds

labeval.py builds a frozen program suite modelled on the BF/XV centred suites, per
(sensor, port) score groups with scales from a calibration ensemble frozen before truth,
two independent truths per case, and native controls as predictors (independent native,
ignored actions, shifted probe geometry, initial persistence, one per mechanism ablation,
and a numerical null), scored with blobround6_eval.score_case. Worlds: phase_membrane and
c53's fed vortices; a band command measures the native-vs-native noise band.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
